{"id":"e03701f9c241ecff","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-cor-konig.md","title":"König's Corollary","display":"cor-konig — König's Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-konig","aliases":["58-cor-konig"],"display":"cor-konig — König's Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-thm-konig.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-konig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-konig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-konig — König's Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b2477134b6aa9c7a\" href=\"?note=b2477134b6aa9c7a\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-konig.md\">../batch02/58-thm-konig.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)\\)</span> (cofinality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 为基数参数上的二元基数指数函数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"949691fe1747f59d\" href=\"?note=949691fe1747f59d\" title=\"58-df-cardinalexpp.md\">58-df-cardinalexpp.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}konig} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa))&gt;\\kappa\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}konig} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa))&gt;\\kappa\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>König's theorem yields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)) &gt; \\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)) &gt; \\kappa\\)</span> for every infinite cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>; the infinitude condition excludes the false case <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^1&gt;1\">\\(1^1&gt;1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In particular, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\kappa} &gt; \\kappa\">\\(2^{\\kappa} &gt; \\kappa\\)</span> for all cardinals <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-konig.md","status":"resolved","id":"b2477134b6aa9c7a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-konig.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)$ (cofinality, see [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinalexpp.md","status":"resolved","id":"949691fe1747f59d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)$ 为基数参数上的二元基数指数函数，见 [[58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}konig} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\\to\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa))>\\kappa","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CardExp}_S(\\kappa,\\mathrm{cf}(\\kappa)) > \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"1^1>1","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\kappa} > \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1125,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-cor-konig.md|58-cor-konig]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["b2477134b6aa9c7a","5fb1c2241d1943d1","5045d216c83e75cb","315ad00b8744fdfc","949691fe1747f59d"]}